0000:                   *  19r8    2004/05/22  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Renamed to 'krn'
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  19r9    2004/07/12  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * F$SRqMem now properly scans the DAT images of the system to update
0000:                   * the D.SysMem map.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  19r10   2019/11/15  L. Curtis Boyle
0000:                   * Optimized register stack copies on 6809 in 3 spots (Loop5, RtiLoop & Looper)
0000:                   *   Saves over 70 cycles per system call that switches between user &
0000:                   *   system states
0000:                   
