00FC:                           tfm     y+,u+           copy it over
00FC:                           ELSE
00FC: C614                      ldb     #SubSiz
00FE: A6A0              Loop2   lda     ,y+             load a byte from source
0100: A7C0                      sta     ,u+             and save to destination
0102: 5A                        decb                    bump counter
0103: 26F9                      bne     Loop2           loop if not done
0105:                           ENDC
