0142: 318D00D7                  leay    >SysCalls,pc    load y with address of table, below
0146: 170250                    lbsr    SysSvc          copy table below into dispatch table
0149:                   
0149:                   * Initialize system process descriptor
0149: DE48                      ldu     <D.PrcDBT       get process table pointer
014B: 9E4A                      ldx     <D.SysPrc       get system process pointer
014D:                   
