014D: AFC4                      stx     ,u              save it as first process in table
014F: AF41                      stx     1,u             save it as the second as well
0151:                         IFNE    H6309
0151:                           oim     #$01,P$ID,x     Set process ID to 1 (inited to 0)
0151:                           oim     #SysState,P$State,x     Set to system state (inited to 0)
0151:                         ELSE
